  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to streamline our requirements while ensuring safety and reliability. I maintain that SAF-01 is critical for secure authentication, and SAF-03's automated alerts are essential for maintaining data accuracy. I support the modification of SAF-02 to align with low-energy communication protocols as proposed by GreenAgent and EfficiencyAgent. Additionally, I agree to drop SAF-04 since it overlaps with RES-07 and EFF-04 regarding historical data retention. This will help us focus on the most critical safety requirements while ensuring compliance and efficiency.",
